Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.36,0:07:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}(Ⅲ)脱出 成功かな｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})逃脱 成功了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.91,0:07:59.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}油断は禁物ﾆｬ｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可不能大意喵。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.61,0:08:04.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}見つけたぞ！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}找到你们了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.82,0:08:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}(ｱﾝﾅ)おりゃ～！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(安娜)嘿呀～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.97,0:08:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}なに!?\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.62,0:08:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}何やつ!?\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么人！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.39,0:08:17.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}俺は ｱﾝﾅだ！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是安娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.71,0:08:21.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}この身に代えても 俺の遊馬に{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算拼上这条命 也别想对我的游马{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.20,0:08:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}指一本 触れさせねえ！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}碰一根手指头！
